        {
          "id": "d05-title",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Cobalt Health — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Cobalt Health — Q4 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Cobalt Health closed Q4 2025 with strong new-logo growth offset by elevated churn in one region. As a company focused on clinic scheduling and telehealth, the leadership team tracked regional performance, headcount, pricing, service levels and vendor spend against the annual plan, all of which are detailed in the sections that follow.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Billing platform is owned by the Developer Experience team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Owen Gallagher, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 80.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Where a metric definition changed during the quarter, the prior quarter has been restated on the new basis.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 104.6
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 122.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d05-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 136.9
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
