        {
          "id": "d05-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q1 2026 the plan assumes stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $23.2M for Q1 2026, weighted towards data-centre capacity and network hardware.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 135.9
